\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">SP-2010-5000</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan, TCPC, External conduit, Fenestrated</td><td>antécédent d'intervention</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0009</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan (TCPC), conduit extracardiaque, non fenestré</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">SP-2010-5010</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan, TCPC, External conduit, Nonfenestrated</td><td>idem</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0010</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan (TCPC), tunnel latéral, fenestré</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">SP-2010-4970</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan, TCPC, Lateral tunnel, Fenestrated</td><td>idem</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0011</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan (TCPC), tunnel latéral, non fenestré</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">SP-2010-4980</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Fontan, TCPC, Lateral tunnel, Nonfenestrated</td><td>idem</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">TAUSSIG-COND-0012</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Réparation à un ventricule et demi</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">SP-2010-4520</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 